            {
                "entry_id": "532e9a0b-2b2c-320d-aea2-1e0acfb369c1",
                "word": "entailed",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "7684d074-fad9-4884-aa19-73d01e58c1e7",
                        "entry_id": "532e9a0b-2b2c-320d-aea2-1e0acfb369c1",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more entailed"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "da19afb2-28c5-4779-b3a6-51d352531b79",
                        "entry_id": "532e9a0b-2b2c-320d-aea2-1e0acfb369c1",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most entailed"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "78957402-3a7a-3a25-9d2a-29927fd9e3fe",
                        "entry_id": "532e9a0b-2b2c-320d-aea2-1e0acfb369c1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having or resulting from a legal entail; pertaining to inheritance that is limited in descent to a particular class of issue."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "51f4197b-a2d1-41fa-9cca-837aa3e0259c",
                                "sense_id": "78957402-3a7a-3a25-9d2a-29927fd9e3fe",
                                "text": "The role, therefore, which prevented the alienation of entailed estates being thus broken in upon, fines and recoveries became the common modes of assurance in conveying that species of property."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d7b6bf7-563f-4d21-951a-99ac634ca35f",
                                "sense_id": "78957402-3a7a-3a25-9d2a-29927fd9e3fe",
                                "text": "Entailed property must be considered by every one who knows thoroughly what society is, as anti-social. It has been set apart by selfish men for the sole benefit of their favoirite heirs, in order that they might be though its instrumentality enabled to live anti-socially, and to be excempt from the usual operation of the laws which take cognizance of other individuals when they contract debt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bda4156a-a48a-49fb-b6e1-7100f34c3418",
                                "sense_id": "78957402-3a7a-3a25-9d2a-29927fd9e3fe",
                                "text": "As you saw in 1.5.1.3, an entailed interest (before 1926 known as a fee tail) was created by a disposition in favour of 'the heirs of the body' of a specified person."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a4238300-d637-372c-8c60-cfc3d50b532a",
                        "entry_id": "532e9a0b-2b2c-320d-aea2-1e0acfb369c1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That is required logically (by something); That has logical dependencies."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2cc7603-c470-4d84-b60a-e8dbaf72c604",
                                "sense_id": "a4238300-d637-372c-8c60-cfc3d50b532a",
                                "text": "Needless to say, the unexplained emergent phenomenon (and the entailed system whose functions can explain it) or the not-yet-existing artifact (and the system required for its construction) can itself be anything from a very simple to a very complex entity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d61454a-0d5f-4eea-b0da-d4b15cabc668",
                                "sense_id": "a4238300-d637-372c-8c60-cfc3d50b532a",
                                "text": "The relation of Keeper is an entailed role of pet dog, inasmuch as every pet dog has someone who is its keeper."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb940287-33aa-4e10-9503-54b033e4d59d",
                                "sense_id": "a4238300-d637-372c-8c60-cfc3d50b532a",
                                "text": "PLC processes can be very entailed and question all parts of the organization, and some are light."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "048179a3-5639-49f4-8a6e-846912ce8b8f",
                                "sense_id": "a4238300-d637-372c-8c60-cfc3d50b532a",
                                "text": "Consequently, the process by which pysico-chemical systems have managed to generate increasingly complex systems, capable somehow of retaining their acquired complexity, should be viewed as an entailed process of accumulative inventions."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
